	<key>readme</key>
	<string># AG Agent Chat Streaming

Streaming OpenAI-compatible agent chat inside Alfred Text View.

Commands:
- `ag &lt;question&gt;`: start a new streaming chat
- `agc &lt;follow-up&gt;`: continue current chat
- `ags`: stop current generation
- `agclear`: clear current session
- `agkey &lt;key&gt;`: save API key to macOS Keychain

Images:
- `image:clip` reads a clipboard image
- `image:"/path/with spaces/a.png"` sends an image file
</string>
